{% comment %}
  Trophy Mart â€” Testimonials & Customisation section
  (mirrors src/components/TestimonialsCustomisationSection.tsx).

  Self-contained. Upload ONLY sections/testimonials-customisation.liquid.

  Testimonials are section blocks ("Testimonial": quote, name, designation,
  organization, city, rating). While no blocks are added, the three built-in
  Trophy Mart testimonials are shown. The quote card auto-advances every 6s,
  pauses on hover, and is switched instantly (no animation), like the React
  design. The right card's CTA links to the section's "CTA link" setting.
{% endcomment %}

